{"id":"7b3dca3480ae2abb","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/366_SK_组合演算.md","title":"366 SK 组合演算","display":"366_SK_组合演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"366-SK-组合演算\">366 SK 组合演算</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。固定可数无限变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。原始组合子集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK}=\\{S,K\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK}=\\{S,K\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 不是原始构造子；若出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，只能作为缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}),\\operatorname{K})\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}),\\operatorname{K})\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项闭包\">2. 项闭包</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{S}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{K}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{K}\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(M,N\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{S})=FV(\\operatorname{K})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV(\\operatorname{S})=FV(\\operatorname{K})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=FV(M)\\cup FV(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathsf{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{S})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{K})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{S})=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{K})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{SK}(N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{SK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{SK}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]\">\\(M[x:=N]\\)</span>，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{S}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S},\\quad \\operatorname{K}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{S}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{S},\\quad \\operatorname{K}[x:=N]=\\operatorname{K},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M_0,M_1)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{app}(M_0[x:=N],M_1[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span> 为文字等同。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-根规约与闭包\">4. 根规约与闭包</h1>\n<p>根规约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SK}\">\\(\\to^0_{SK}\\)</span> 只有两族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y)\\to^0_{SK}X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y)\\to^0_{SK}X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z)\\to^0_{SK}\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z)\\to^0_{SK}\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,K}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{K},X),Y),X):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nX,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,S}\n=\n\\{(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},X),Y),Z),\n\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(X,Z),\\operatorname{app}(Y,Z))):\nX,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SK}=\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{SK}=\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,K}\\cup\\mathsf{Red}_{SK,S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span> 为满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}_{SK}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}_{SK}\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}_{SK}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}_{SK}(C,P)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}_{SK}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}_{SK}(P,C)\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}:\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{hole}_{SK},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{hole}_{SK},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{appL}_{SK}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M),P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{appL}_{SK}(C,P),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M),P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{appR}_{SK}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(\\operatorname{appR}_{SK}(P,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(P,\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一步规约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{SK}\">\\(\\to_{SK}\\)</span> 是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SK}\">\\(\\to^0_{SK}\\)</span> 并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\to_{SK}N\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{app}(M,P)\\to_{SK}\\operatorname{app}(N,P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\to_{SK}N\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{app}(M,P)\\to_{SK}\\operatorname{app}(N,P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\to_{SK}N\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{app}(P,M)\\to_{SK}\\operatorname{app}(P,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\to_{SK}N\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{app}(P,M)\\to_{SK}\\operatorname{app}(P,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的最小关系。有限规约对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{SK}M_{i+1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\,M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\,M_i\\to_{SK}M_{i+1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\to^*_{SK}N\">\\(M\\to^*_{SK}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\\)</span>，其首项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-转换证明\">5. 转换证明</h1>\n<p>定义转换证明的单步规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{SK}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{SK}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\to_{SK}N\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):N\\to_{SK}M\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\langle M\\rangle,N):M\\equiv_\\alpha N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>转换证明是有限非空序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\">\\((M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1})\\)</span>，相邻项必须属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=_{SK}N\">\\(M=_{SK}N\\)</span> 当且仅当存在首项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、末项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 的转换证明。\n初始项族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SK}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SK}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{var}(x):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>转换证明对象集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(M_0,\\ldots,M_{n-1}):n&gt;0,\\forall i&lt;n\\ M_i\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\forall i+1&lt;n\\ ((\\langle M_i\\rangle,M_{i+1})\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{SK}=(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\to^0_{SK},\\operatorname{I}_{def}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{SK}=(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K},\\to^0_{SK},\\operatorname{I}_{def}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{I}_{def}=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}),\\operatorname{K})\">\\(\\operatorname{I}_{def}=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{S},\\operatorname{K}),\\operatorname{K})\\)</span> 是缩写而非原始项。</p>\n<p>规约与证明关系均作为类型化关系给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to^0_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\quad\n\\to_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to^0_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\quad\n\\to_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}^{&lt;\\omega},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证明步必须是两族根规约的应用上下文闭包、其逆向，或文字等同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的出现只能经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{I}_{def}\">\\(\\operatorname{I}_{def}\\)</span> 展开为 SK 项，不形成新的根规约族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-原始常元边界\">6. 原始常元边界</h1>\n<p>原始组合子集合严格固定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK}=\\{S,K\\},\n\\qquad\nI\\notin\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{comb}(I)\\notin\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK}=\\{S,K\\},\n\\qquad\nI\\notin\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{comb}(I)\\notin\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{I}_{def}\">\\(\\operatorname{I}_{def}\\)</span> 只是第 5 节给出的 SK 项缩写。SK 没有绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK}=\\{(M,M):M\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_\\alpha=\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-上下文与证明证书\">7. 上下文与证明证书</h1>\n<p>上下文闭包可以等价写成类型化规则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M)\\rangle,\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK},\\ M\\to^0_{SK}N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK}\n=\n\\{(\\langle\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,M)\\rangle,\\operatorname{plug}_{SK}(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK},\\ M\\to^0_{SK}N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{SK}=\\{(P,Q):(\\langle P\\rangle,Q)\\in\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK}\\}\">\\(\\to_{SK}=\\{(P,Q):(\\langle P\\rangle,Q)\\in\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK}\\}\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{SK}\\)</span> 的每个相邻端点均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK}\\)</span> 检验。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-最终系统\">8. 最终系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SK}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK},\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{SK},\\operatorname{Sub}_{SK},\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK},\\operatorname{I}_{def},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SK},\\mathsf{Delta}_{SK},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK},\\operatorname{plug}_{SK},\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK},\\to^0_{SK},\\to_{SK},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK},\\to^*_{SK},\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK},\\mathsf{Der}_{SK},=_{SK}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SK}=(\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK},\\mathsf{Tm}_{SK},FV,\\operatorname{BV}_{SK},\\operatorname{Sub}_{SK},\\equiv_\\alpha^{SK},\\operatorname{I}_{def},\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{SK},\\mathsf{Delta}_{SK},\\mathsf{RedCtx}_{SK},\\operatorname{plug}_{SK},\\mathsf{CtxRule}_{SK},\\to^0_{SK},\\to_{SK},\\mathsf{RedDer}_{SK},\\to^*_{SK},\\mathsf{Rule}_{SK},\\mathsf{Der}_{SK},=_{SK}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.1-完成核对\">8.1 完成核对</h2>\n<p>本文将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 排除为原始组合子，并把 SK 的两族根规约、应用上下文闭包和转换证明显式列出。系统不含类型、语义解释或额外组合子常元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"366-SK-组合演算","text":"366 SK 组合演算","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项闭包","text":"2. 项闭包","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-根规约与闭包","text":"4. 根规约与闭包","level":1},{"id":"5.-转换证明","text":"5. 转换证明","level":1},{"id":"6.-原始常元边界","text":"6. 原始常元边界","level":1},{"id":"7.-上下文与证明证书","text":"7. 上下文与证明证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-最终系统","text":"8. 最终系统","level":1},{"id":"8.1-完成核对","text":"8.1 完成核对","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Comb}_{SK}=\\{S,K\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"t